# M11: never bake secrets, virtualenvs, local data or build junk into the image.
# LITUBIK_SECRET_KEY signs JWTs AND decrypts stored API keys — it must only be
# injected at runtime (docker-compose / env), never copied via `COPY backend/`.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/venv
# the runtime data dir only — NOT backend/app/data, which ships the EZproxy
# directory and the demo seed with the code (`**/data` excluded those too, and
# the hosted image answered "proxy directory is missing from this installation")
data
backend/data
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
packaging/dist
packaging/build
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
.git
.gitignore
**/secret.key
# full-text credential files, if any were left next to the sources
backend/app/services/fulltext/institutions.json
backend/app/services/fulltext/proxies.json
